---
/**
 * KaTeX's stylesheet, isolated so it travels with the pages that need it.
 *
 * Importing it in the shared layout put 23kb of equation typography into the
 * stylesheet every single route downloads, to serve one post. Astro bundles a
 * component's CSS into the pages that render that component, so gating on this
 * component is enough: the styles follow the maths.
 *
 * Renders nothing.
 */
import "katex/dist/katex.min.css";
---
